s on Mt. Olympus. Please tell me that it will be at least a Terra Incognita in this regard. My mind won't ease until I know.</div> </div> </div> </div>What Joe Carriker's said re: the Atlantean and WWII pantheons is that he's not making any promises <i>not</i> to revisit some of those concepts in the future. Not &quot;he won't revisit them&quot;, but &quot;not promising he won't revisit them&quot;.<br /> <br /> That wouldn't rule out revisiting Atlantis as part of the Greek cosmology, though.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-01T12:02:00-08:00","id":356735,"title":"","content":"Thank you. That is reassuring. Given all the negativity towards Atlantis last year, I thought that there was some sort of agenda going on here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}